    // only, while `province` still drives the population lookup. Needed for Naga City: the
    // POPULATION sheet keys its figure as "Camarines Sur|Naga City" (Naga City is administratively
    // part of Camarines Sur), but the line-list sheets tag their own Naga City rows with
    // Province=="NAGA CITY" directly - two different conventions for the same place.
